  "definition_ja": "割り算の答え。余りのある割り算では、17 ÷ 5 = 3 余り 2 の 3 を商という。",
  "definition_en": "The answer to a division problem. When there is a remainder, as in 17 divided by 5 giving 3 with a remainder of 2, the quotient is 3.",
  "latex": null,
  "spoken_en": null,
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "20 divided by 4 is 5, so the quotient is 5.",
      "ja": "20 ÷ 4 = 5 だから、商は 5 だね。",
      "register": "spoken"
    },
    {
      "en": "Find the quotient and the remainder when 47 is divided by 6.",
      "ja": "47 を 6 で割ったときの商と余りを求めよ。",
      "register": "written"
    }
  ],
  "collocations": [],
  "pitfalls": [
    "「a を b で割った商」は the quotient when a is divided by b、または the quotient of a and b（a ÷ b の順）。",
    "余りは remainder（エントリ remainder）。整式の割り算でも、商と余りは quotient と remainder。",
    "微分の「商の微分公式」は quotient rule（エントリ quotient-rule）。quotient はそこでも割り算の結果 f(x)/g(x) の意味。"
  ],
